@page "/components/filterbuilder"
@using AtomBlazor.Demo.Services

<PageTitle>@L.T("Filter Builder 筛选构建器 - Atom BlazorUI", "Filter Builder - Atom BlazorUI")</PageTitle>

<div class="space-y-8 max-w-7xl">
    <div>
        <div class="space-y-3">
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Filter Builder</h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground">
                @L.T("可视化的查询构建器，用来搭建数据筛选表达式：支持 AND/OR 逻辑、嵌套分组，以及按类型匹配的值输入框。", "A visual query builder for constructing data filter expressions with AND/OR logic, nested groups, and type-aware value inputs.")
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Overview -->
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-dashed bg-muted/30 p-6 space-y-5">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">@L.T("工作原理", "How it works")</h2>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p>
                    筛选构建器让用户通过直观的界面搭建结构化的筛选表达式。
                    每个筛选条件都是一棵由<strong>条件</strong>（字段 + 运算符 + 值）与
                    <strong>AND/OR 分组</strong>组成的树，分组可以嵌套到任意可配置的深度。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p>
                    The Filter Builder lets users construct structured filter expressions through an intuitive UI.
                    Each filter is a tree of <strong>conditions</strong> (field + operator + value) combined with
                    <strong>AND/OR groups</strong> that can be nested to any configurable depth.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p>
                    <strong>定义字段</strong> —— 提供一组 <code>FilterField</code> 定义，描述可筛选的列、
                    它们的数据类型以及可选的枚举选项。组件会为每种类型自动挑选正确的运算符与值输入框
                    （文本搜索、数值比较、日期选择、多选等）。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p>
                    <strong>Define fields</strong> — Provide an array of <code>FilterField</code> definitions describing the
                    filterable columns, their data types, and any enum options. The component automatically selects the
                    correct operators and value inputs for each type (text search, numeric comparison, date pickers, multi-select, etc.).
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p>
                    <strong>绑定与响应</strong> —— 用 <code>@@bind-Filter</code> 双向绑定到 <code>FilterDefinition</code>
                    模型。订阅 <code>OnFilterChanged</code>，在用户编辑条件时应用筛选。
                    变更默认会做防抖（300 毫秒），也可以启用显式的 Apply 按钮来应对开销较大的查询。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p>
                    <strong>Bind and react</strong> — Use <code>@@bind-Filter</code> for two-way binding to a <code>FilterDefinition</code>
                    model. Subscribe to <code>OnFilterChanged</code> to apply filters whenever the user edits a condition.
                    Changes are debounced by default (300ms), or you can enable an explicit Apply button for expensive queries.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p>
                    <strong>随处求值</strong> —— 把筛选树转换成 <code>Func&lt;T, bool&gt;</code>
                    做客户端内存过滤，或转换成 <code>Expression&lt;Func&lt;T, bool&gt;&gt;</code>
                    供 EF Core 及其他 IQueryable 提供程序做服务端查询。筛选还可以序列化为 JSON，用于存储或传输。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p>
                    <strong>Evaluate anywhere</strong> — Convert the filter tree into a <code>Func&lt;T, bool&gt;</code>
                    for client-side in-memory filtering, or an <code>Expression&lt;Func&lt;T, bool&gt;&gt;</code>
                    for server-side queries with EF Core and other IQueryable providers. Filters can also be serialized
                    to JSON for storage or transmission.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">@L.T("理解分组", "Understanding groups")</h3>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p>
                    一个 <code>FilterDefinition</code> 就是一个<strong>分组</strong> —— 它持有逻辑运算符
                    （<code>AND</code> 或 <code>OR</code>）、一份条件列表，以及一份嵌套的子分组列表。
                    这种递归结构让你能搭建任意复杂的查询。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p>
                    A <code>FilterDefinition</code> is a <strong>group</strong> — it holds a logical operator
                    (<code>AND</code> or <code>OR</code>), a list of conditions, and a list of nested child groups.
                    This recursive structure lets you build arbitrarily complex queries.
                </p>
                        </text>
}

            <div class="space-y-2">
                <p class="font-medium text-foreground">@L.T("扁平筛选（不含分组）", "Flat filter (no groups)")</p>
                <p>@L.T("所有条件都位于根分组，并共用同一个运算符。", "All conditions live in the root group and share the same operator.")</p>
                <pre class="rounded-lg border bg-muted p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto"><code>Name contains "Smith" <strong>AND</strong> Age greater than 25 <strong>AND</strong> Status equals "Active"</code></pre>
                @if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p>每个条件都必须为真。等价于：<br />
                    <code class="text-xs">(Name ∧ Age ∧ Status)</code></p>
                                </text>
}
                else
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p>Every condition must be true. This is equivalent to:<br />
                    <code class="text-xs">(Name ∧ Age ∧ Status)</code></p>
                                </text>
}
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2">
                @if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p class="font-medium text-foreground">嵌套分组 —— 混合 AND 与 OR</p>
                                </text>
}
                else
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p class="font-medium text-foreground">Nested group — mixing AND &amp; OR</p>
                                </text>
}
                @if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p>
                        要表达<em>“Name 包含 Smith，并且（Status 是 Active 或 Status 是 Pending）”</em>，就需要一个嵌套分组。
                        根分组用 <code>AND</code>，子分组用 <code>OR</code> 来组合这些状态条件：
                    </p>
                                </text>
}
                else
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p>
                        To express <em>"Name contains Smith AND (Status is Active OR Status is Pending)"</em>, you need a nested group.
                        The root group uses <code>AND</code>, and a child group uses <code>OR</code> for the status conditions:
                    </p>
                                </text>
}
                <pre class="rounded-lg border bg-muted p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto"><code>WHERE <strong>AND</strong>
├─ Name contains "Smith"
└─ GROUP <strong>OR</strong>
   ├─ Status equals "Active"
   └─ Status equals "Pending"</code></pre>
                @if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p>它的求值结果是：<br />
                    <code class="text-xs">(Name) AND (Status = Active OR Status = Pending)</code></p>
                                </text>
}
                else
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p>This evaluates as:<br />
                    <code class="text-xs">(Name) AND (Status = Active OR Status = Pending)</code></p>
                                </text>
}
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2">
                <p class="font-medium text-foreground">@L.T("更深层的嵌套", "Deeper nesting")</p>
                @if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p>
                        分组可以嵌套多层。例如<em>“找出姓名含 Smith 的活跃用户，他们要么是 30 岁以上的 Admin，
                        要么是 40 岁以上的 Manager”</em>：
                    </p>
                                </text>
}
                else
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p>
                        Groups can be nested multiple levels deep. For example, <em>"find active users named Smith who are either
                        Admins over 30 or Managers over 40"</em>:
                    </p>
                                </text>
}
                <pre class="rounded-lg border bg-muted p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto"><code>WHERE <strong>AND</strong>
├─ Name contains "Smith"
├─ Status equals "Active"
└─ GROUP <strong>OR</strong>
   ├─ GROUP <strong>AND</strong>
   │  ├─ Role equals "Admin"
   │  └─ Age greater than 30
   └─ GROUP <strong>AND</strong>
      ├─ Role equals "Manager"
      └─ Age greater than 40</code></pre>
                @if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p>它的求值结果是：<br />
                    <code class="text-xs">(Name ∧ Status) AND ((Role = Admin ∧ Age &gt; 30) OR (Role = Manager ∧ Age &gt; 40))</code></p>
                                </text>
}
                else
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p>This evaluates as:<br />
                    <code class="text-xs">(Name ∧ Status) AND ((Role = Admin ∧ Age &gt; 30) OR (Role = Manager ∧ Age &gt; 40))</code></p>
                                </text>
}
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2">
                <p class="font-medium text-foreground">@L.T("控制嵌套深度", "Controlling depth")</p>
                @if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p>
                        用 <code>MaxDepth</code> 参数限制分组可以嵌套的深度。
                        设 <code>MaxDepth="0"</code> 只做扁平筛选（不显示 “Add group” 按钮），
                        或调大它以允许更复杂的查询。每一层深度都会用一条彩色的左边框标示出来，方便用户看清结构。
                    </p>
                                </text>
}
                else
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p>
                        Use the <code>MaxDepth</code> parameter to limit how deeply groups can nest.
                        Set <code>MaxDepth="0"</code> for flat-only filters (no "Add group" button),
                        or increase it to allow more complex queries. Each depth level is visually indicated with a
                        colored left border so users can easily see the structure.
                    </p>
                                </text>
}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Basic Example -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("基础筛选构建器", "Basic Filter Builder")</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                @L.T("用字符串、数字、日期、枚举与布尔字段搭建扁平筛选。", "Build flat filters with string, number, date, enum, and boolean fields.")
            </p>
        </div>
        <FilterBuilder @bind-Filter="basicFilter"
                         Fields="@basicFields"
                         MaxDepth="0"
                         OnFilterChanged="@(_ => StateHasChanged())" />
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <CodeBlock Source="Components/FilterBuilder/basic.txt" />
            <FilterJsonViewer Filter="basicFilter" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Nested Groups -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("嵌套 AND/OR 分组", "Nested AND/OR Groups")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    用嵌套分组搭建复杂查询。点击 “Add group” 即可创建拥有自己 AND/OR 逻辑的子分组。
                    每一层深度都会用彩色的左边框区分，最大嵌套深度可以配置。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Create complex queries with nested groups. Click "Add group" to create sub-groups with their own AND/OR logic.
                    Each depth level is visually distinguished with a colored left border. Maximum nesting depth is configurable.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <FilterBuilder @bind-Filter="nestedFilter"
                         Fields="@basicFields"
                         MaxDepth="3"
                         OnFilterChanged="@(_ => StateHasChanged())" />
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <CodeBlock Source="Components/FilterBuilder/nested-groups.txt" />
            <FilterJsonViewer Filter="nestedFilter" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- With Apply Button -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("Apply 按钮模式", "Apply Button Mode")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    设 <code>ShowApplyButton="true"</code> 后，只有用户点击 Apply 按钮才会应用变更。
                    适合开销较大的服务端查询，可以避免每次按键都触发一次请求。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    With <code>ShowApplyButton="true"</code>, changes are only applied when the user clicks the Apply button.
                    Useful for expensive server-side queries where you want to avoid triggering a request on every keystroke.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <FilterBuilder @bind-Filter="applyFilter"
                         Fields="@basicFields"
                         ShowApplyButton="true"
                         OnFilterChanged="HandleApplyFilterChanged" />

        @if (applyFilterApplied)
        {
            <Badge Variant="BadgeVariant.Default">
                @L.F("已应用筛选，共 {0} 个条件。", "Filter applied with {0} condition(s)", applyFilter.TotalConditionCount)
            </Badge>
        }
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <CodeBlock Source="Components/FilterBuilder/apply-button.txt" />
            <FilterJsonViewer Filter="applyFilter" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- DataTable Integration -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("与 DataTable 集成", "DataTable Integration")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    把筛选构建器与 DataTable 搭配起来，实现可交互的数据浏览。
                    筛选条件会用 <code>ToFunc&lt;T&gt;()</code> 编译成 <code>Func&lt;T, bool&gt;</code>，
                    并在用户修改条件时于客户端侧应用。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Pair the filter builder with a DataTable for interactive data exploration.
                    The filter is compiled to a <code>Func&lt;T, bool&gt;</code> using <code>ToFunc&lt;T&gt;()</code>
                    and applied client-side as users modify conditions.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <FilterBuilder @bind-Filter="tableFilter"
                         Fields="@personFields"
                         OnFilterChanged="HandleTableFilterChanged" />

        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Badge Variant="BadgeVariant.Secondary">
                @L.F("共 {0} 条记录（总计 {1} 条）。", "{0} of {1} records", filteredPeople.Count, allPeople.Count)
            </Badge>
        </div>

        <DataTable TData="Person" Data="@filteredPeople" InitialPageSize="10">
            <Columns>
                <DataTableColumn TData="Person" TValue="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)" Header="@(L.T("姓名", "Name"))" Sortable />
                <DataTableColumn TData="Person" TValue="string" Property="@(p => p.Email)" Header="@(L.T("邮箱", "Email"))" />
                <DataTableColumn TData="Person" TValue="int" Property="@(p => p.Age)" Header="@(L.T("年龄", "Age"))" Sortable />
                <DataTableColumn TData="Person" TValue="DateTime" Property="@(p => p.JoinDate)" Header="@(L.T("加入日期", "Join Date"))" Sortable>
                    <CellTemplate Context="person">
                        @person.JoinDate.ToString("dd MMM yyyy")
                    </CellTemplate>
                </DataTableColumn>
                <DataTableColumn TData="Person" TValue="string" Property="@(p => p.Role)" Header="@(L.T("角色", "Role"))" />
                <DataTableColumn TData="Person" TValue="string" Property="@(p => p.Status)" Header="@(L.T("状态", "Status"))">
                    <CellTemplate Context="person">
                        <Badge Variant="@(person.Status == "Active" ? BadgeVariant.Default : BadgeVariant.Outline)">
                            @person.Status
                        </Badge>
                    </CellTemplate>
                </DataTableColumn>
                <DataTableColumn TData="Person" TValue="bool" Property="@(p => p.IsActive)" Header="@(L.T("是否启用", "Active"))">
                    <CellTemplate Context="person">
                        @(person.IsActive ? L.T("是", "Yes") : L.T("否", "No"))
                    </CellTemplate>
                </DataTableColumn>
            </Columns>
        </DataTable>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <CodeBlock Source="Components/FilterBuilder/datatable-integration.txt" />
            <FilterJsonViewer Filter="tableFilter" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- LINQ & EF Core Integration -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">LINQ 与 EF Core 集成</h2>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">LINQ &amp; EF Core Integration</h2>
                        </text>
}
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    <code>FilterDefinition</code> 模型可以转换成可执行代码，客户端与服务端场景都能用。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    The <code>FilterDefinition</code> model can be converted to executable code for both client-side and server-side scenarios.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-dashed bg-muted/30 p-6 space-y-4">
            <div class="space-y-2">
                @if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                                <text>
                                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">客户端侧 —— <code>ToFunc&lt;T&gt;()</code></h3>
                                </text>
}
                else
                {
                                <text>
                                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Client-side — <code>ToFunc&lt;T&gt;()</code></h3>
                                </text>
}
                @if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        通过反射把筛选树编译成 <code>Func&lt;T, bool&gt;</code> 委托。
                        适合用 LINQ-to-Objects 过滤内存中的集合。
                    </p>
                                </text>
}
                else
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        Compiles the filter tree into a <code>Func&lt;T, bool&gt;</code> delegate using reflection.
                        Ideal for filtering in-memory collections with LINQ-to-Objects.
                    </p>
                                </text>
}
                <pre class="rounded-lg border bg-muted p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto"><code>var predicate = filter.ToFunc&lt;Person&gt;(fields);
var results = people.Where(predicate).ToList();</code></pre>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-2">
                @if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                                <text>
                                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">服务端侧 —— <code>ToExpression&lt;T&gt;()</code></h3>
                                </text>
}
                else
                {
                                <text>
                                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Server-side — <code>ToExpression&lt;T&gt;()</code></h3>
                                </text>
}
                @if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        构建一个 LINQ <code>Expression&lt;Func&lt;T, bool&gt;&gt;</code>，可以传给
                        EF Core 的 <code>Where()</code> 方法。这棵表达式树会由数据库提供程序翻译成 SQL，
                        因此过滤发生在数据库层，而不是应用内存里。
                    </p>
                                </text>
}
                else
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        Builds a LINQ <code>Expression&lt;Func&lt;T, bool&gt;&gt;</code> that can be passed to
                        EF Core's <code>Where()</code> method. The expression tree is translated to SQL by the database provider,
                        so filtering happens at the database level rather than in application memory.
                    </p>
                                </text>
}
                <pre class="rounded-lg border bg-muted p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto"><code>var expression = filter.ToExpression&lt;Person&gt;(fields);
var results = await dbContext.People
    .Where(expression)
    .ToListAsync();</code></pre>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-2">
                @if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                                <text>
                                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">序列化 —— <code>ToJson()</code> / <code>FromJson()</code></h3>
                                </text>
}
                else
                {
                                <text>
                                    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Serialization — <code>ToJson()</code> / <code>FromJson()</code></h3>
                                </text>
}
                @if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        把整棵筛选树序列化成 JSON 以便持久化（例如把用户自定义的筛选存进数据库，
                        或在 API 请求里于客户端与服务端之间传递筛选）。
                    </p>
                                </text>
}
                else
                {
                                <text>
                                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        Serialize the entire filter tree to JSON for persistence (e.g., saving user-defined filters to a database
                        or transmitting filters between client and server in an API request).
                    </p>
                                </text>
}
                <pre class="rounded-lg border bg-muted p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto"><code>// Save
var json = filter.ToJson();

// Restore
var restored = FilterDefinitionExtensions.FromJson(json);</code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>
        <CodeBlock Source="Components/FilterBuilder/linq-expression.txt" />
    </div>

    <!-- Compact Mode -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("紧凑模式", "Compact Mode")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    设 <code>Compact="true"</code> 得到更小的布局，适合放在工具栏或内联位置。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Use <code>Compact="true"</code> for a smaller layout suitable for toolbars and inline placement.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <FilterBuilder @bind-Filter="compactFilter"
                         Fields="@basicFields"
